# The mutable-userland escape hatch (plan/13), gated on INCLUDE_DISTROBOX. In @base rather than
# @desktop deliberately: distrobox is a CLI tool and belongs in the --console-only image too.
# Two atoms only — crun, conmon, catatonit, containers-common and its tail (netavark,
# aardvark-dns, passt, fuse-overlayfs, nftables) are all RDEPEND and must NOT be listed here.
# Same discipline plan/03 applies to baloo's four packages: listing a transitive dep only
# invites a version pin this set does not own.
app-containers/podman            #distrobox
app-containers/distrobox         #distrobox
